From: Guitar RackCraft <build@guitarrackcraft.local>
Subject: [PATCH] SPIRV: include cstdint for uint32_t declarations

GCC 16 no longer reaches the fixed-width integer declarations through the
transitive standard-library includes used by this older glslang source.

---
 SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h b/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
--- a/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
+++ b/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
@@ -58,8 +58,9 @@ namespace spv {
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <set>
 #include <sstream>
 #include <stack>
 #include <unordered_map>
 #include <map>
